WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
Thank you so much.

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like Michelle Obama
at the Grammys.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.704 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Please.

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:06.072 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Please sit down.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:06.740 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-We're a hot crowd.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:10.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You are a hot, hot crowd.
Thank you, sir.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:10.610 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yikes.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I love having my dad
at the show. It's great.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:16.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, the 61st Grammy Awards
were last night.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:19.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Michelle Obama
made a surprise appearance.

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:22.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
Only --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:22.789 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was great.

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:23.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
The only bigger surprise
would be

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
if President Trump appeared
at the Latin Grammys.

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
That would be --
-Wow.

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.196 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:33.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
I also saw that Nancy Pelosi
got a standing ovation

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.135 line:92%
at a Grammy party this weekend.

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:36.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which was great
until she realized

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
they were all clapping
like this.

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:41.708 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I want to say congrats
to Cardi B,

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:48.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
who won the Grammy
for Best Rap Album.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.582 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
We love Cardi B.

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:51.384 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
After she won,
Cardi went onstage

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:56.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
and talked about
how nervous she was.

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.123 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Check out what she said.

00:00:57.123 --> 00:01:00.527 line:92%
-Ooh, the nerves are so bad.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe I need to start
smoking weed.

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.698 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:08.735
-Then everyone in the crowd was
like, "You're at the Grammys.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.737 line:92%
Just take a really deep breath."

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.906 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.874 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You get it?

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:15.875 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Let's get to some news.

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
I read that Congress
is offering Trump

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:19.546 line:92%
$2 billion for his border wall

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:23.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
instead of the $5.7 billion
that he asked for.

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:24.084 line:92%
Which means a lot of immigrants

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:27.420
will just bang their shins
on the wall while they hop over.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.655 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Tiny.

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:31.191 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:34.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
But Trump was examined by
11 specialists for four hours,

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:37.831 size:84% position:42%
and they said that he's
in very good health.

00:01:37.831 --> 00:01:40.033 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Scattered applause ]

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.101 line:92%
Nothing says very good health

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:45.371
like having to be examined by
11 specialists over four hours.

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:49.142 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:52.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
Even E.T. only had
five specialists.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.446 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:54.280 line:92%
Some more political news.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.850
This weekend,
Minnesota senator Amy Klobuchar

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:59.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
announced that she's running
for president

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:02.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
in an outdoor rally
in the middle of a blizzard.

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:03.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this is real.
Just take a look.

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:04.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is her at the beginning
of the rally.

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:08.628
-Now, we don't let a little snow
stop us.

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:09.429 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:11.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
And here she is
at the end of the rally.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:16.269 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A chorus of different faiths,
races, creeds...

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:17.871 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:19.572 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:20.540 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I think --

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:21.641 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:24.844
I think we have a shot of one
of her supporters in the crowd.

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:27.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
Take a look.
There, yeah.

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:29.816 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow.

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:33.386
-Well, after Klobuchar's event,
the President tweeted about it.

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:35.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said,
"By the end of her speech,

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:38.224 align:start size:94% position:6%
she looked like
a snowman(woman)."

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:38.892 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.892 --> 00:02:40.827
And he was like, "The difference
between a snowman

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:43.596 size:88% position:44%
and a snowwoman is where
you stick the carrot."

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:44.898 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:45.732 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What are you doing?

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:48.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the nose.
It's the nose.

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:51.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
Finally, Valentine's Day
is this Thursday.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:54.274
And I saw that if you go to
Hooters -- if you go to Hooters,

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:57.644
you can shred a photo of your ex
and get free wings.

00:02:57.644 --> 00:02:59.946 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:03.016
It's fun until you realize
that you got back at your ex

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:06.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
by eating alone at a Hooters
on Valentine's Day.

